{"product_id":"lost-innocence","title":"Lost Innocence","description":"\u003cp\u003eSet in a small Somerset town, Susan Lewis’s powerful new novel tells the story of a fifteen-year-old girl who accuses a seventeen-year-old boy of rape. But did he, or didn’t he? Deep-rooted family divisions not only get in the way of finding out, they threaten to split the whole village.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 154 x 233\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Susan Lewis\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780099525646\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 480\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45862638649497,"sku":"17RE-1-9780099525646","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/690336e5c2be4_Lost_Innocence_Susan_Lewis.jpg?v=1762366426","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/lost-innocence","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}